hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16188","Sufyan ibn Uyaynah narrated to us, from Safwan ibn Sulaym, from Nafi ibn Jubayr, from Sahl ibn Abi Hathmah, conveying it to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him). He said: And Sufyan once said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: When one of you prays toward a sutrah, let him draw near to it, that Satan not cut his prayer upon him."
